# www → apex (takes effect once www.soleach.com is attached to the Pages
# project as a custom domain).
https://www.soleach.com/* https://soleach.com/:splat 301

# Locale-less entry points → Turkish default (mirrors the root redirect).
# People and AI engines routinely strip the locale segment from links.
/  /tr  302
/blog  /tr/blog  302
/blog/*  /tr/blog/:splat  302
/services  /tr/services  302
/about  /tr/about  302
/contact  /tr/contact  302
